usage: c27_campaign.py [-h]
                       {prepare,fit,price,freeze,campaign,verify,analyze,integration}
                       ...

Frozen C27 data/model/controller audit and campaign harness. All offline game
values stay in this Python analyst process. Native run requests contain public
history/cues and the frozen TRAIN model only. No command runs at import. Paths
derive from this file so a restored checkout remains executable.

positional arguments:
  {prepare,fit,price,freeze,campaign,verify,analyze,integration}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
